meta {
  name: Credentials
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/diagnostics/credentials
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  # Credentials Diagnostics

  Verifies which Webull credentials the application actually loaded — WITHOUT
  exposing the full secret.

  Returns:
  - `appKey` — shown in full (identifier, already sent as the x-app-key header)
  - `appSecretMasked` — first 4 + last 4 chars only
  - `appSecretLength` — length of the loaded secret
  - `appSecretSha256` — SHA-256 fingerprint of the secret

  ## Verify an exact match
  Compute the SHA-256 of your intended secret locally and compare it to
  `appSecretSha256`:

      echo -n "your_secret_here" | shasum -a 256

  Matching fingerprints prove the exact value was loaded, without the plaintext
  ever leaving the process.

  ## Safety gate
  Disabled by default — returns `404` unless enabled via:

      webull.diagnostics.credentials-endpoint-enabled: true

  Local debugging only. Never enable in a shared or production environment.
}
